          "python",
          "5-Fold Cross-Validation Results:\nConfiguration         Mean CV Acc      Std      Min      Max\n------------------------------------------------------------\nmax_depth=3                0.9332   0.0196   0.9123   0.9649\nmax_depth=5                0.9332   0.0181   0.9123   0.9561\nmin_split=20               0.9367   0.0205   0.9123   0.9649\nmin_leaf=10                0.9367   0.0181   0.9123   0.9649\nccp_alpha=0.01             0.9279   0.0185   0.9035   0.9474\nFull (no limits)           0.9209   0.0160   0.9035   0.9386"
